    <description>Objects: Standard Account (Provider), Custom Claim__c (Fields: Status__c, Rejection_Reason__c, Reviewer__c).

Requirement: Build a Screen Flow where an internal agent selects a Provider Account. The next screen uses a Data Table component to display all related Claim__c records currently in &quot;Pending&quot; status. The agent can select multiple claims from this table simultaneously. On the final screen, the agent selects a single Status__c (e.g., &quot;Rejected&quot;) and a Rejection_Reason__c. The flow must loop through the selected claims, apply these updates to a collection variable in memory, and commit the entire collection to the database using a single Update Records element.

V2 =&gt; - added fault path
           - added decision for no claims record handling</description>
